WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.303 --> 00:00:05.057
Let's run the numbers again. The plan is...

00:00:09.504 --> 00:00:10.848
Hey! Give that back!

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:16.060
Thank you for your patronage!

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.105
That's a big order. Having a get-together?

00:00:18.408 --> 00:00:20.838
Also, no drinks?

00:00:20.843 --> 00:00:23.553
I could throw some in on the house!

00:00:24.517 --> 00:00:26.176
Haha, thanks, but no need

00:00:26.239 --> 00:00:27.522
Just the to-go orders

00:00:27.522 --> 00:00:28.770
You got it

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:31.716
Morning!

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:32.666
Hey!

00:00:35.631 --> 00:00:39.011
The briefing this afternoon... You'd better not skip again

00:00:39.011 --> 00:00:40.482
Ah... Yeah, yeah

00:00:40.482 --> 00:00:43.278
Not ordering anything? I could treat you

00:00:43.278 --> 00:00:45.193
Why? What's the occasion?

00:00:45.385 --> 00:00:47.512
Uh, just in a good mood

00:00:48.216 --> 00:00:49.088
*gasp* Look...!

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:56.595
Got him!

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:04.011
Hey, little help here!

00:01:10.106 --> 00:01:11.268
Thanks, you two!

00:01:15.718 --> 00:01:18.249
Sorry, we were bribed

00:01:24.566 --> 00:01:25.593
Morning!

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.656
Mitya? Morni—

00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:29.523
Huh? What is...

00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:30.597
It's for you!

00:01:31.084 --> 00:01:32.232
Stay safe!

00:01:46.726 --> 00:01:48.211
What is this?

00:01:48.944 --> 00:01:51.142
Breakfast. You should really make it a habit

00:01:52.025 --> 00:01:52.739
Nice weather for a picnic

00:01:52.739 --> 00:01:54.137
How about it?

00:01:57.613 --> 00:01:59.797
So what was all this about today?

00:01:59.995 --> 00:02:01.509
It's part of my "post-brush-with-death bucket list"

00:02:01.509 --> 00:02:03.871
I got paid yesterday

00:02:04.353 --> 00:02:07.285
So I thought I'd get everyone breakfast

00:02:08.389 --> 00:02:09.504
And test out

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:12.005
How this new energy performs during high-speed movement

00:02:12.569 --> 00:02:14.556
I thought you'd make someone else do that

00:02:14.783 --> 00:02:17.439
You're always nagging me to go for morning runs

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.006
Consider today

00:02:19.006 --> 00:02:21.263
The official start of my workout regimen!

00:02:21.263 --> 00:02:23.355
That's the third time I've heard that

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.608
Ah, the sauce got everywhere...

00:02:27.984 --> 00:02:29.551
And whose fault is that?

